## Summary:

The /accounts page passes all ACCESSIBILITY.md requirements (points 1-15, applicable subset). All conformance tests included in handlers_test.go; testing of markup, form semantics, ARIA attributes, and error handling all green. CRUD fully round-trips through accounts.Save/Load. Pattern editor resolves actual file matches. Anchors persist with end-of-day semantics clearly stated. Delete requires confirm step. 

One pre-existing site-wide observation (prefers-reduced-motion not guarded) noted but not introduced by A6; A6's base.html changes are minimal (route registration only).

Toolchain clean (build, vet, test, staticcheck, gofmt). Manifest accurate. Ruling 2026-08-16a (template rendering) compliance verified.
